                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c11bc69a-a802-461f-af5e-0118adf9f2c2",
                                "sense_id": "803abde1-4e5e-35aa-bb26-04e77232bdce",
                                "text": "— Ду́шенька, рекоменду́ю тебе́, — продолжа́л Собаке́вич, — Па́вел Ива́нович Чи́чиков! У губерна́тора и почтме́йстера име́л честь познако́миться.",
                                "translation": "'My love,' Sobakevitch went on, 'let me introduce Pavel Ivanovitch Tchitchikov; I had the honour of making his acquaintance at the governor's and at the police-captain's.'",
                                "english": "'My love,' Sobakevitch went on, 'let me introduce Pavel Ivanovitch Tchitchikov; I had the honour of making his acquaintance at the governor's and at the police-captain's.'"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
